## AC-SPN-03 — gaps between beats in the AC-SPN-01 manifest, then check-cuts at the beat boundaries
$ node -e "const m=require('./spine/manifest.json');for(let i=1;i<m.clips.length;i++){const p=m.clips[i-1],c=m.clips[i];const g=c.startMs-(p.startMs+p.durationMs);console.log('clip',p.n,'->',c.n,'gap',g,'ms',g>=400?'ok':'FAIL')}"
clip 1 -> 2 gap 606 ms ok
clip 2 -> 3 gap 606 ms ok
exit=0
$ node lib/verify/check-cuts.mjs spine/narration.wav --cuts 5697,16121 --min-silence-ms 400 --expect-cuts 2
